 "note": "p24 from sn74abt646a p.1 (DB/DGV/DW/NS/NT/PW and SN54 JT/W; 74ABT646ADBLE/SN74ABT646ADBLE are DB SSOP-24 orderables not in the packaging table), sn74abt646 p.1, sn74als646a p.1 (DW/NT/JT), sn74hc646 p.1, sn74hct646 p.1, sn74lvc646a p.1, sn74lvth646 p.1: all identical. lccc28 (FK) from sn74abt646a p.1, sn74lvth646 p.1 (5962-9674801Q3A), sn74hc646 p.1, sn74als646a p.1: NC on 1, 8, 15, 22. Function table (all 646 PDFs): OE H = isolation (both ports read, registers still clock); OE L + DIR L: SBA L = real-time B to A, SBA H = stored B to A; OE L + DIR H: SAB L = real-time A to B, SAB H = stored A to B; CLKAB/CLKBA rising edge stores the A/B bus whatever OE/DIR are. (sn74abt646a p.4, sn74als646a p.3, sn74hc646 p.2, sn74lvc646a p.2, sn74lvth646 p.2).",
